      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/e19adc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-30T00:38:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Is it allowed to use Omnitron, Onmitron IV, and Omnitron X all in the same game? My daughter and I tried this, and we had troubles deciding what to do with cards that affected drone cards and components, as all three have cards of the same type. For example, Converyor Panels is a component from the environment deck that states \"Drone cards are immune to melee damage.\" Would this apply to all drones from all three versions, or just the one from the environment deck. Then there's the S-83 Assault Drone from the villian deck, that deals x melee damage, where x = the number of drones in play plus 1. Would that apply to all drones, or just the drones from the villian deck?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:22.935Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
