      "created_at": "2015-03-30T00:48:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is a similar interaction with Voss and the Mobile Defense Platform. &nbsp;The Battalion Brute, Battalion Mechanic, and Battalion Mechanic all have the minion keyword which means they apply towards his win condition, whether he would flip, and DR he gets for minions in play. &nbsp;</p>",
