      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/e19adc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-30T00:49:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That makes sense. What about my first question? Is it even allowed officially to have them in the same game, or is it akin to multiple of the same hero? Technically all three are the same being, just different incarnations of him.</p>",
