      "raw": "[quote=\"AlexxKay\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\">Whatever the timeline fiction says, the real restriction is that you can only have one copy of a given DECK in a game.&nbsp; As long as the &#39;alternate&#39; version has its own unique deck (not just a variant Hero card), it&#39;s allowed.<br />&nbsp;</div>\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nSo because they are in fact a hero deck, a villian deck, and an environment deck, they affect each other in terms of &quot;drone&quot; and &quot;component&quot; cards, but they are all allowed in the same game?\n",
