      "id": 138282,
      "name": "Ameena",
      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-30T13:48:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We actually tried that a week or so ago - Omnitron IV was the last of the nvew environments that we hadn't tried yet, and out of all the possibilities available, the random roll to pick the villain gave us Omnitron, so I decided to \"complete the set\" and play as Omni-10. We got destroyed because of all the drones that do \"drones +1\" damage while there were about six drones in play across both the villain and environment decks :P. It also didn't help that on one of his play-two-cards turns Omnitron played Technological Singularity (when I had about three equipment cards out, so that was nine damage right there though I don't think the other two heroes in the game really got hit as they didn't really have anything out) and then Sedative Flechettes (which <span class=\"bbcode-i\">did</span> hurt the other two a lot) :P.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:14:47.646Z",
