      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "We actually tried that a week or so ago - Omnitron IV was the last of the nvew environments that we hadn&#39;t tried yet, and out of all the possibilities available, the random roll to pick the villain gave us Omnitron, so I decided to &quot;complete the set&quot; and play as Omni-10. We got destroyed because of all the drones that do &quot;drones +1&quot; damage while there were about six drones in play across both the villain and environment decks :P. It also didn&#39;t help that on one of his play-two-cards turns Omnitron played Technological Singularity (when I had about three equipment cards out, so that was nine damage right there though I don&#39;t think the other two heroes in the game really got hit as they didn&#39;t really have anything out) and then Sedative Flechettes (which [i]did[/i] hurt the other two a lot) :P.\n",
