      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-30T21:52:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/finest-and-newest-legacy\">Here's a thread</a> discussing multiple Legacies. <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/18661#comment-18661\">Paul (Bender, not Parsons) had a nice comment at the end</a> that there shouldn't be multiple versions of a hero. I have no recollection of Chistopher ever making a comment that you can have multiple versions, although he might have said they don't care what we actually do, but that officially you aren't supposed to (as Paul did).</p>",
