      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silopolis/{size}/2166_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-31T13:44:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The one cool thing that allowing multiple versions of a deck with variants would be the \"Flash of Two Worlds\" aspect, where the Legacies team up to fight La Capitan or whoever. It would make for a cool story, but I'm not sure how fun the game is.</p><p>Limiting the \"Limiteds\" sounds like a good balance. I get why the restriction is there, and I'd only be interested in it as a \"story mission\" or some kind of goofy house-rules match.</p>",
