      "cooked": "<p>Yup - it only specifies the type of card it can affect (components), not which deck said cards must belong to. It's like attacks which hit \"a target\" can hit <span class=\"bbcode-i\">anything</span>, even the person using the attack, and stuff which occurs \"at the start/end of each turn\" do so at that point in <span class=\"bbcode-i\">every</span> turn, not just that deck's turn (missed this for a while with that card in Fanatic's deck…Divine Focus, I think? <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Every</span> turn, not just hers!) :D.</p>",
